issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-02-01T20:20:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T14:19:40Z","closed_at":"2026-02-03T14:18:44Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible at least in 4.5 and 4.6 (and certainly all versions before)\n\n### System information\n\nall systems\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy game is translated in several languages and the font I used didn't included all asian/hindi characters, so I were relying on the font system fallback to display them but I've got reports saying that it is not always working on some macOS or Android devices.\n\nSo I included a big 8MB font as fallback to support them, and I started to see big performance regressions. My game is displaying small labels for damages, and the font size depends of the quantity of damage, so it can vary a lot. But with this new 8MB font, each new font size ends up in a lag (Godot seems to rasterize the entire font for this font size).\n\nI have found 2 workarounds:\n- use a fixed font size and then scale the label down for small damage, it works but the text looks a bit ugly when scaled down\n- preload all the possible font sizes on the first screen with hidden labels, it takes time and memory at launch but then it is fast to use in-game and the text rendering is nice.\n\nI wonder how other games are handling that? Is it possible to rasterize only used characters and not the complete font?\nFeel free to close this ticket if you consider this as normal and unavoidable.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI joined a sample 4.6 projet where you simply need to press the \"Start test\" button and see the FPS reducing.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-font-perf.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24995661/test-font-perf.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115731/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}